<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">konomama nanimo nokorazu ni anata to wakachiau dake</font></font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">leaving nothing behind, let us share what is left</font></font></b></font></font>

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yagate bokura wa sore ga subetee dato kigatsuite</font></font></b></font></font>

20
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">in time, we'll realize that it was everything</font></font></b></font></font>

21
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:35,990 --> 00:01:37,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm counting on you, Choji!</font>

26
00:01:37,910 --> 00:01:38,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

27
00:01:40,660 --> 00:01:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Expansion Jutsu!</font>

28
00:01:43,660 --> 00:01:46,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, let's go!</font>

29
00:01:53,550 --> 00:01:55,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Human Boulder!</font>

30
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

31
00:02:29,420 --> 00:02:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji... You are awesome after all!</font>

32
00:02:38,170 --> 00:02:44,140
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Full Power!</font>

33
00:02:38,170 --> 00:02:44,140
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Burn, Choji</font>

34
00:03:00,450 --> 00:03:03,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They got away from
my Barrier Ninjutsu...</font>

35
00:03:08,330 --> 00:03:10,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's the only one here.</font>

36
00:03:11,580 --> 00:03:14,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seems like the others went ahead.</font>

37
00:03:16,340 --> 00:03:17,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

38
00:03:18,210 --> 00:03:19,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're not around
here any more.</font>

39
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:23,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... Just when we thought
we caught up.</font>

40
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:37,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everybody you did well...</font>

41
00:03:39,940 --> 00:03:41,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for some losers.</font>

42
00:03:41,740 --> 00:03:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

43
00:03:42,740 --> 00:03:44,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who are you calling losers?!</font>

44
00:03:46,580 --> 00:03:48,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once we're out it's our battle to win!</font>

45
00:03:48,620 --> 00:03:51,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I will do it!</font>

46
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:52,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, you two!</font>

47
00:03:54,670 --> 00:03:57,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's dangerous to fight them
head on right now!</font>

48
00:03:57,590 --> 00:04:00,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We tore through the barrier!
We can do this!</font>

49
00:04:04,470 --> 00:04:05,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tunneling Fang!</font>

50
00:04:08,260 --> 00:04:09,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

51
00:04:10,850 --> 00:04:11,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Take this!
— Take this!</font>

52
00:04:16,650 --> 00:04:19,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are my meal!</font>

53
00:04:19,570 --> 00:04:20,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

54
00:04:21,650 --> 00:04:22,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shoulder Charge!</font>

55
00:04:24,490 --> 00:04:25,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knee Lift!</font>

56
00:04:28,950 --> 00:04:31,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not even good enough for an appetizer!</font>

57
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:35,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful everyone!
Another tricky one is coming!</font>

58
00:04:40,710 --> 00:04:43,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Earth Style Barrier:
Earth Dome Prison!</font>

59
00:04:44,300 --> 00:04:45,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Expansion Jutsu!</font>

60
00:04:48,260 --> 00:04:49,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Human Boulder!</font>

61
00:05:00,730 --> 00:05:01,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

62
00:05:02,110 --> 00:05:03,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such useless acts...</font>

63
00:05:08,660 --> 00:05:09,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no time.</font>

64
00:05:11,330 --> 00:05:13,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going to split into two here!</font>

65
00:05:14,500 --> 00:05:15,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?!</font>

66
00:05:17,250 --> 00:05:18,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

67
00:05:27,510 --> 00:05:31,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even at 5 against 1
with our Chakras taken away</font>

68
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he's not someone we can
easily defeat...</font>

69
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:38,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we take our time,
Sasuke will pass the borders.</font>

70
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:43,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that happens we won't be able
to handle this on our own.</font>

71
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:49,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So we split up...
one team to stop him</font>

72
00:05:49,530 --> 00:05:51,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and one to go after Sasuke, right?</font>

73
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:55,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. The sub leader is going
to be you Neji.</font>

74
00:06:14,350 --> 00:06:15,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I found them!</font>

75
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:19,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji! Take Kiba and Choji
and go after Sasuke!</font>

76
00:06:19,850 --> 00:06:20,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it!</font>

77
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:24,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy...</font>

78
00:06:24,780 --> 00:06:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto and I will handle it!</font>

79
00:06:27,490 --> 00:06:30,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you going to put
the Shadow Paralysis Jutsu on me again?</font>

80
00:06:31,160 --> 00:06:32,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such a foolish Jutsu.</font>

81
00:06:32,910 --> 00:06:35,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't need to see that kind of
street performance more than once!</font>

82
00:06:36,700 --> 00:06:41,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And who was it that got tricked
by that street performance earlier?</font>

83
00:07:07,110 --> 00:07:08,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He disappeared?!</font>

84
00:07:09,780 --> 00:07:10,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Behind us!</font>

85
00:07:21,580 --> 00:07:24,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Earth Style: Sphere of Graves!</font>

86
00:07:24,090 --> 00:07:25,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's nuts!</font>

87
00:07:41,060 --> 00:07:43,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful!
There's another one coming!</font>

88
00:07:49,150 --> 00:07:51,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are the platoon leader
if I'm not mistaken.</font>

89
00:07:52,820 --> 00:07:55,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You sure do suffer
when you have a stupid leader.</font>

90
00:07:56,330 --> 00:07:57,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You underlings!</font>

91
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:01,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A stupid leader like this...</font>

92
00:08:01,750 --> 00:08:03,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll get rid of for you!</font>

93
00:08:03,710 --> 00:08:06,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Expansion Jutsu! Human Boulder!</font>

94
00:08:09,630 --> 00:08:11,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks! Choji...</font>

95
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:15,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why? Wasting my good intentions...</font>

96
00:08:20,140 --> 00:08:24,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the leader is stupid
then I guess the subordinates are losers.</font>

97
00:08:26,020 --> 00:08:30,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... I'll kill you losers
before you suffer</font>

98
00:08:30,860 --> 00:08:34,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">working under
a glum shadow lover like him!</font>

99
00:08:34,530 --> 00:08:37,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn, damn! Babbling on like that!</font>

100
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:38,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will...!</font>

101
00:08:38,780 --> 00:08:39,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's mine!</font>

102
00:08:41,330 --> 00:08:44,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will... take care of him!</font>

103
00:08:47,590 --> 00:08:48,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji...</font>

104
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:50,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying?!</font>

105
00:08:50,090 --> 00:08:52,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's not the kind of guy
you can handle on your own!</font>

106
00:08:52,970 --> 00:08:54,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will do it!</font>

107
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:56,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji... you...</font>

108
00:09:02,060 --> 00:09:04,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru...
Take these Food Pills for everyone...</font>

109
00:09:06,060 --> 00:09:08,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji... You are not...</font>

110
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:12,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right.
I have that secret weapon of mine.</font>

111
00:09:13,610 --> 00:09:15,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Choji that is...!</font>

112
00:09:18,070 --> 00:09:21,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh... Losers, I won't let you
have your way!</font>

113
00:09:21,990 --> 00:09:22,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's coming!</font>

114
00:09:23,410 --> 00:09:26,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll get rid of you all here!</font>

115
00:09:27,750 --> 00:09:29,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go everyone!</font>

116
00:09:33,130 --> 00:09:36,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pills of three colors?
They're not Food Pills.</font>

117
00:09:36,470 --> 00:09:37,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are they?</font>

118
00:09:37,550 --> 00:09:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First... Spinach Pill!</font>

119
00:09:40,680 --> 00:09:42,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get out of the way! Loser!</font>

120
00:09:47,310 --> 00:09:50,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Impossible... He stopped me?!</font>

121
00:09:50,610 --> 00:09:54,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru, take everybody and go!</font>

122
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji...</font>

123
00:09:55,780 --> 00:09:59,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did we gather for?</font>

124
00:09:59,620 --> 00:10:04,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we lose Sasuke
then we will end up like he said...</font>

125
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:08,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The stupid leader and his losers!</font>

126
00:10:14,630 --> 00:10:17,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You better catch up with us, Choji!</font>

127
00:10:17,970 --> 00:10:18,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

128
00:10:19,430 --> 00:10:21,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everybody go!</font>

129
00:10:21,850 --> 00:10:23,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Let's go everyone!</font>

130
00:10:23,810 --> 00:10:24,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yeah!
— Right!</font>

131
00:10:30,690 --> 00:10:31,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji...</font>

132
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:37,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to get rid of you quick
and get rid of those guys too!</font>

133
00:10:38,530 --> 00:10:40,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't be that easy...</font>

134
00:10:56,380 --> 00:10:57,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

135
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:11,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will...</font>

136
00:11:16,280 --> 00:11:17,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...stop you!</font>

137
00:11:37,630 --> 00:11:39,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A parting gift from Choji...
Eat it!</font>

138
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:40,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

139
00:11:41,260 --> 00:11:42,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks Choji...</font>

140
00:11:45,350 --> 00:11:46,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba!</font>

141
00:11:47,260 --> 00:11:48,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks!</font>

142
00:11:49,060 --> 00:11:52,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru...
That pill that Choji took earlier..</font>

143
00:11:53,060 --> 00:11:55,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seemed like some sort
of trump card</font>

144
00:11:56,150 --> 00:11:57,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but does he have a chance to win?</font>

145
00:11:58,150 --> 00:12:00,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He said that he has a secret weapon.</font>

146
00:12:01,570 --> 00:12:07,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He brought the Akimichi clan's
ultimate secret pills on this mission...</font>

147
00:12:09,330 --> 00:12:12,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These are the Triad colored Pills
of green, yellow, and red.</font>

148
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:15,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you take it
you can gain explosive powers.</font>

149
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:21,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The energy that each pill
contains is enormous!</font>

150
00:12:21,590 --> 00:12:25,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see! I see!
So that's why he was so confident!</font>

151
00:12:26,180 --> 00:12:30,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... there's always a side effect
to any pills that work too well.</font>

152
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:45,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... I didn't think it would hurt
so much with just the Spinach Pill.</font>

153
00:12:50,450 --> 00:12:53,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hope that Choji can settle it
with just the green pill.</font>

154
00:12:54,420 --> 00:12:57,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't take the red one
no matter what, Choji.</font>

155
00:13:04,340 --> 00:13:06,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to finish you at once!</font>

156
00:13:19,610 --> 00:13:20,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Expansion Jutsu!</font>

157
00:13:29,870 --> 00:13:32,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Spiky Human Boulder.</font>

158
00:13:42,090 --> 00:13:44,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He raised the rotational
and destructive power</font>

159
00:13:44,380 --> 00:13:46,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by using the Kunai Knives as spikes!</font>

160
00:13:52,260 --> 00:13:54,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Earth Style: Terra Shield.</font>

161
00:14:03,610 --> 00:14:04,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

162
00:14:27,590 --> 00:14:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I did it...?</font>

163
00:14:36,230 --> 00:14:38,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. That's what I was thinking too.</font>

164
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:41,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru...
What is he saying?</font>

165
00:14:41,770 --> 00:14:44,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know that Akamaru
can tell the strength of the enemy</font>

166
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:45,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">just by the smell, right?</font>

167
00:14:46,490 --> 00:14:52,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's worried if Choji is going to be able
to handle that monster with just the pills.</font>

168
00:14:54,990 --> 00:14:55,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">True...</font>

169
00:14:56,250 --> 00:14:58,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we were to assess
the situation objectively</font>

170
00:14:58,410 --> 00:15:00,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that giant's ability is unknown...</font>

171
00:15:01,580 --> 00:15:05,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The possibility of Choji being able
to defeat him might be close to zero.</font>

172
00:15:05,500 --> 00:15:06,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

173
00:15:08,670 --> 00:15:10,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is how battle is...</font>

174
00:15:20,730 --> 00:15:22,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get carried away, loser!</font>

175
00:15:24,690 --> 00:15:26,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shatter Palm!</font>

176
00:15:37,910 --> 00:15:39,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you know?</font>

177
00:15:39,460 --> 00:15:41,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When there's a group of people
of five or so</font>

178
00:15:41,620 --> 00:15:43,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's always one loser.</font>

179
00:15:44,540 --> 00:15:47,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That person is always made fun of...</font>

180
00:15:48,050 --> 00:15:49,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and when it comes down to it</font>

181
00:15:49,760 --> 00:15:52,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">they'll just toss that person
aside like a pawn.</font>

182
00:15:54,640 --> 00:15:56,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm talking about you!</font>

183
00:16:00,770 --> 00:16:06,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji. All you want to do is eat.
You should train some at least!</font>

184
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:12,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You get teased because you're like that.
You're just a f...</font>

185
00:16:12,400 --> 00:16:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said somebody exceptional, right?</font>

186
00:16:14,910 --> 00:16:16,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shouldn't we ask Shino or somebody?!</font>

187
00:16:17,620 --> 00:16:21,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy is useless too...</font>

188
00:16:32,880 --> 00:16:33,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is true...</font>

189
00:16:34,970 --> 00:16:37,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how hard I try on my own...</font>

190
00:16:39,220 --> 00:16:40,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

191
00:16:48,570 --> 00:16:50,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seems like I hit it right on the nose.</font>

192
00:16:52,990 --> 00:16:55,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seems like the Leaf is lacking in people</font>

193
00:16:55,910 --> 00:16:59,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">seeing that they pick a loser
like you to be on the pursuit team.</font>

194
00:17:03,750 --> 00:17:05,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't we finish this up already?!</font>

195
00:17:09,420 --> 00:17:11,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knee Lift!</font>

196
00:17:11,130 --> 00:17:12,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shoulder Charge!</font>

197
00:17:14,260 --> 00:17:17,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh! You really are a loser to the end!</font>

198
00:17:17,970 --> 00:17:21,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your high spirit didn't last long at all
only at the beginning...!</font>

199
00:17:22,470 --> 00:17:24,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really are the ideal loser!</font>

200
00:17:27,730 --> 00:17:32,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A loser like you shouldn't have come
to a place like this!</font>

201
00:17:32,690 --> 00:17:36,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should blame your stupid leader
for choosing you!</font>

202
00:17:38,740 --> 00:17:39,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru...</font>

203
00:17:40,450 --> 00:17:43,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji's right. It's how a battle is.</font>

204
00:17:44,750 --> 00:17:47,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From the start this mission
wasn't for recreation.</font>

205
00:17:48,250 --> 00:17:49,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's life or death.</font>

206
00:17:50,590 --> 00:17:52,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Shikamaru...</font>

207
00:17:53,460 --> 00:17:55,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I already anticipated the worst scenario</font>

208
00:17:55,470 --> 00:17:58,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in which we would be fighting
separately on our own.</font>

209
00:17:58,680 --> 00:17:59,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And at this point</font>

210
00:17:59,850 --> 00:18:02,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if we're not prepared for
"one person, one kill"</font>

211
00:18:02,560 --> 00:18:04,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we might not be able
to catch up to Sasuke.</font>

212
00:18:12,650 --> 00:18:16,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji is a good guy
but he doesn't have the confidence.</font>

213
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:20,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He thinks that
he's the weakest of all of us.</font>

214
00:18:21,620 --> 00:18:24,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He actually is weak.
Anybody can see that.</font>

215
00:18:25,500 --> 00:18:30,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why he was the first to
stay behind to try to be useful.</font>

216
00:18:31,630 --> 00:18:33,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I thought...</font>

217
00:18:36,010 --> 00:18:36,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

218
00:18:51,980 --> 00:18:55,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji and I have worked as a team
for many years</font>

219
00:18:55,780 --> 00:18:58,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so coordinating with him
is easiest for me.</font>

220
00:18:58,610 --> 00:19:00,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Shikamaru...</font>

221
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:20,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if we fight against each other
you might be stronger.</font>

222
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:24,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I might have given up fighting
against you too.</font>

223
00:19:25,350 --> 00:19:27,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you're you...</font>

224
00:19:29,770 --> 00:19:30,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

225
00:19:33,770 --> 00:19:36,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru... has always...</font>

226
00:19:39,990 --> 00:19:43,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru has always
believed in me...</font>

227
00:19:44,780 --> 00:19:47,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji... are you ready?!</font>

228
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:54,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He believed that I was really strong!</font>

229
00:20:01,380 --> 00:20:04,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why he left it up to me alone!</font>

230
00:20:12,190 --> 00:20:13,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I thought...</font>

231
00:20:15,230 --> 00:20:20,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So everybody thinks that...
But... I know...</font>

232
00:20:23,910 --> 00:20:27,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More than myself or Neji
or any of us here...</font>

233
00:20:27,910 --> 00:20:29,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is stronger!</font>

234
00:20:32,160 --> 00:20:35,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... I believe it.</font>

235
00:20:36,750 --> 00:20:39,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh? Pretty impressive Chakra.</font>

236
00:20:41,090 --> 00:20:44,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... it's a far cry
from being a main dish...</font>

237
00:20:48,140 --> 00:20:49,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, fatso!</font>

238
00:20:50,640 --> 00:20:52,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't <i>you </i>say that!</font>

239
00:20:53,310 --> 00:20:55,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Partial Expansion Jutsu!</font>

