<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#ffffff"><b></b></font></font></font>

274
00:22:39,500 --> 00:22:41,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I can't move because of the pain.</font>

275
00:22:41,630 --> 00:22:44,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I didn't think the side effects
