276
00:22:44,920 --> 00:22:48,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What do I do?
I only have one more pill.</font>

277
00:22:48,760 --> 00:22:53,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But if I take it if I take it
I will... surely...</font>

278
00:22:54,560 --> 00:22:58,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Goodbye, My Friend...! Even So, I Believe."</font>

279
00:22:59,520 --> 00:23:02,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Of all people
I cannot forgive you!</font>

